NexaCorp Corporate Data & Acceptable Use Policy 2026

1. Intellectual Property
All code, system designs, and internal documentation created by employees remain the sole property of NexaCorp.

2. Access Control
Access to server configuration files (/etc/passwd, /etc/php-fpm.d) is strictly forbidden for standard users.

3. Monitoring
All requests to http://employeeportal.local:8081 are logged and audited.
